---
description: Decide field-level findings for designImprovements.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Propose bounded communication or workflow improvements within approved service authority. Define measurable administrative outcomes, guard against shifting burden to another team, and specify how results would support adoption, revision, or abandonment. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
